# Expo Continuous Native Generation (CNG) -- android/ and ios/ are generated
# fresh from app.json by `expo prebuild` (locally or by EAS Build on its own
# Linux runners), so committing them risks a stale/host-specific native
# project fighting a differently-configured build machine. Removed from
# version control on purpose after this exact problem caused hours of
# Windows-only build failures.
/android
/ios

node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
*.orig.*
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
.env*.local
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
.DS_Store
